OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting in cost of living
OL,4,Acrisis 'never an excuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chief has said there can never
OL,7,Fbe an excuse for shoplifting, even when
OL,8,Ffamilies are struggling to feed
OL,9,Fchildren during the cost of living
OL,10,Fcrisis.
OL,12,FAssistant Chief Constable Alex Goss,
OL,13,Ffrom Merseyside Police, who is also the
OL,14,FNational Police Chiefs' Council's lead
OL,15,Fon retail crime, was responding to
OL,16,Flisteners' questions on BBC Radio
OL,17,FMerseyside's Hotseat phone-in on what
OL,18,Fcan be done to stop the thefts.
OL,20,FOne listener said some shoplifters were
OL,21,F"just mums trying to feed their
OL,22,Fchildren".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
