OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting in cost of living
OL,4,Acrisis 'never an excuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Goss said that while he had
OL,7,Fsympathy "fully appreciated" the
OL,8,Fposition that some families were in,
OL,9,Fthere were "other avenues you can look
OL,10,Fat for support".
